  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Karthigai Deepam festival in Tamil Nadu has become the center of a complex legal and political controversy surrounding the traditional lamp-lighting ritual at the Tirupparankundram hilltop temple. Recent reports indicate that the ritual failed to proceed as expected, sparking immediate public debate and scrutiny from state officials who have accused the temple board of disregarding Supreme Court directives. The matter is now headed to the Supreme Court for further judicial review. Parallel to these religious and legal developments, broader political tensions have surfaced in the region, with local political leaders questioning the interactions between members of the ruling DMK party and the Governor. Meanwhile, logistical operations surrounding the festival, such as those at the Tiruvannamalai railway station, have seen significant activity, with special train services and crowd management protocols being implemented to handle the high volume of devotees participating in the broader festival period.",
